### Leonardo AI API 직접 테스트
@leonardoKey = L2A_k5i1RzE8hE7r6t3K6k7v6m3j6d0i6p8f9g7h6k5l6n4o3c2b1a0
@generationId = FILL_AFTER_STEP1
@imageGenId   = FILL_AFTER_STEP2  # generated_images[0].id
@nobgJobId    = FILL_AFTER_STEP3



### ══════════════════════════════════════
###  STEP 1: 이미지 생성 요청
###  -> 응답의 generate.generationId 를 @generationId 에 기입
### ══════════════════════════════════════

### 1-A. 기본 이미지 생성 (프롬프트만)
POST https://cloud.leonardo.ai/api/rest/v2/generations
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{leonardoKey}}

{
  "model": "flux-pro-2.0",
  "public": false,
  "parameters": {
    "width": 576,
    "height": 1024,
    "quantity": 1,
    "prompt": "a young woman with long black hair, wearing a white hanbok, standing in a traditional korean courtyard, soft sunlight, detailed illustration"
  }
}

### 1-B. 스타일 UUID 적용 이미지 생성
POST https://cloud.leonardo.ai/api/rest/v2/generations
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{leonardoKey}}

{
  "model": "flux-pro-2.0",
  "public": false,
  "parameters": {
    "width": 576,
    "height": 1024,
    "quantity": 1,
    "prompt": "a young woman with long black hair, wearing a white hanbok, standing in a traditional korean courtyard, soft sunlight, detailed illustration",
    "styleUUID": "STYLE_UUID_HERE"
  }
}

### 1-C. Image Reference(initImageId) 적용 이미지 생성 — 감정 변형용
POST https://cloud.leonardo.ai/api/rest/v2/generations
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{leonardoKey}}

{
  "model": "flux-pro-2.0",
  "public": false,
  "parameters": {
    "width": 576,
    "height": 1024,
    "quantity": 1,
    "prompt": "same character, crying expression, tears on cheeks",
    "guidances": {
      "image_reference": [
        {
          "image": {
            "id": "{{imageGenId}}",
            "type": "GENERATED"
          },
          "strength": "HIGH"
        }
      ]
    }
  }
}



### ══════════════════════════════════════
###  STEP 2: 생성 상태 폴링
###  -> status == "COMPLETE" 확인 후
###     generated_images[0].id 를 @imageGenId 에 기입
### ══════════════════════════════════════

### 2. 생성 상태 조회
GET https://cloud.leonardo.ai/api/rest/v1/generations/{{generationId}}
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{leonardoKey}}



### ══════════════════════════════════════
###  STEP 3: NOBG (배경 제거) 요청
###  -> 응답의 sdNobgJob.id 를 @nobgJobId 에 기입
### ══════════════════════════════════════

### 3. NOBG 변환 요청
POST https://cloud.leonardo.ai/api/rest/v1/variations/nobg
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{leonardoKey}}

{
  "id": "{{imageGenId}}"
}



### ══════════════════════════════════════
###  STEP 4: NOBG 완료 폴링
###  -> generated_image_variation_generic 배열에서
###     transformType == "NOBG" 인 항목의 url 확인
### ══════════════════════════════════════

### 4. NOBG 상태 조회
GET https://cloud.leonardo.ai/api/rest/v1/variations/{{nobgJobId}}
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{leonardoKey}}
